# 3:1 / 4:1 Dual Wall Adhesive Heat Shrink (双壁含胶热缩管 3:1/4:1)

**Document:** Engineering reference, P07, revision 2026-09  
**Product family:** Adhesive Heat Shrink  
**Manufacturer:** WELLELE (Well Electric)  
**Product page:** https://heatshrinktubes.net/products/dual-wall-adhesive-heat-shrink-tubing-3to1-4to1.html

